<title>HUNGARY: Hungagent boosts H1 group profits.</title>
<headline>Hungagent boosts H1 group profits.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	   13.7	vs     9.7</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	     16.0	vs     0.4</p>
<p>    Group net sales		   180.9	vs   206.1</p>
<p>    Group other revenue		 0.8	vs     3.3</p>
<p>    Group material expenditures   123.3	vs   146.4</p>
<p>    Group personnel expenditures   24.8	vs    27.5</p>
<p>    Group depreciation		  7.5	vs    10.5</p>
<p>    Group other costs		   8.4	vs    12.2</p>
<p>    Group other expenditures	  4.1	vs     3.2</p>
<p>    Group net financial income	1.7 profit vs   7.1 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue		 5.9	vs     3.7</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	   4.2	vs    10.8</p>
<p>    Group net extraordinary income  0.6 profit vs   2.2 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	   1.0	vs     0.2</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.	   0.5	vs     2.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Hungagent Rt is a trading company. The figures are unaudited, were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards and are consolidated.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
